{"2195350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "胡辣三国", "steam_appid": 2195350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "《胡辣三国》是一款策略类实时对抗游戏。玩法别具一格，以民、枪、弓、骑、智、将、主等角色形成循环克制，还有雀神玩家熟悉的玩法融入，玩家可以策略出牌、以智取胜。该游戏可同时容纳多名玩家进行紧张刺激的对抗，在调兵遣将之间，更有细腻生动的特效地图，帅气美腻的三国英雄现身，陪伴你的群雄争霸之路！<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/cb9d23f18b6a4f09c46aee547d2f700d.webp?t=1671413311\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/cb9d23f18b6a4f09c46aee547d2f700d.poster.avif?t=1671413311\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span><br>开创绝无仅有的新奇玩法，融合雀神、消消乐等游戏形制，在施展谋划策略的同时享受碰杠胡的乐趣，让你回味无穷，欲罢不能。绝对找不到第二个拥有如此脑洞大开玩法的游戏！ <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/9763f5a6eda7f4826b6ddf3f09ec817f.webp?t=1671413311\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/9763f5a6eda7f4826b6ddf3f09ec817f.poster.avif?t=1671413311\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span><br>重返三国战场，统帅三军，实时对抗。一键开启在线对局，尽情享受与其他玩家对抗的乐趣。这世界，只看你如何调兵遣将，以智取胜，走上巅峰！<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/89f520bf33ebbf9d984fb75a3519dac0.webp?t=1671413311\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/89f520bf33ebbf9d984fb75a3519dac0.poster.avif?t=1671413311\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span><br>江山如画，如此多娇。3D战局地图，动态特效，陪伴作战使对抗赛事不再乏味。局内更有英雄人物全彩帅气立绘，美女国色天香，陪你踏遍山河。<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/3fb78f88d01bdf86f903cf46488942fd.webp?t=1671413311\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/3fb78f88d01bdf86f903cf46488942fd.poster.avif?t=1671413311\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span><br>烽烟四起，谁主春秋。即时战略玩法使战局风云多变，上一秒旗开得胜，下一秒潦倒失魂。当你血流成河，是采用快攻流加快结束战局，还是乌龟流打法先苟一波再说？权谋博弈，风起云涌，全看足智多谋的你如何扭转局势。<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《胡辣三国》期待你的加入，点亮对局，成就霸业！官方QQ群：731209487</h2>", "about_the_game": "《胡辣三国》是一款策略类实时对抗游戏。玩法别具一格，以民、枪、弓、骑、智、将、主等角色形成循环克制，还有雀神玩家熟悉的玩法融入，玩家可以策略出牌、以智取胜。该游戏可同时容纳多名玩家进行紧张刺激的对抗，在调兵遣将之间，更有细腻生动的特效地图，帅气美腻的三国英雄现身，陪伴你的群雄争霸之路！<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/cb9d23f18b6a4f09c46aee547d2f700d.webp?t=1671413311\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/cb9d23f18b6a4f09c46aee547d2f700d.poster.avif?t=1671413311\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span><br>开创绝无仅有的新奇玩法，融合雀神、消消乐等游戏形制，在施展谋划策略的同时享受碰杠胡的乐趣，让你回味无穷，欲罢不能。绝对找不到第二个拥有如此脑洞大开玩法的游戏！ <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/9763f5a6eda7f4826b6ddf3f09ec817f.webp?t=1671413311\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/9763f5a6eda7f4826b6ddf3f09ec817f.poster.avif?t=1671413311\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span><br>重返三国战场，统帅三军，实时对抗。一键开启在线对局，尽情享受与其他玩家对抗的乐趣。这世界，只看你如何调兵遣将，以智取胜，走上巅峰！<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/89f520bf33ebbf9d984fb75a3519dac0.webp?t=1671413311\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195350/extras/89f520bf33ebbf9d984fb75a3519dac0.poster.avif?t=1671413311\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span><br>江山如画，如此多娇。3D战局地图，动态特效，陪伴作战使对抗赛事不再乏味。局内更有英雄人物全彩帅气立绘，美女国色天香，陪你踏遍山河。<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><sourc